ried to say, now he's a gay man and whatever he did is now ok. \n\nA CNN host got caught waking off during a work zoom call. \n\nNow multiple cities and states won't arrest naked people next to schools (Washington, Oregon, probably more) \n\nAlso, those XXX theaters never made any sense. Fill it full of dudes in the dark, THEN WHAT? They shoulda been banned to begin with. Even in the 1980s you were like who the fuck wants to go with a bunch of guys there? WTF are the guys doing in the theater? \n\nThey also lasted crazy long after VHS came out. People would go to video stores, then go to the adult section, get a dirty movie, and GO HOME WITH IT. Yet these dumb theaters lasted way longer after that. Into the 2000s and beyond. ", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1785831108921, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Herpawinski", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Fun Fact: In 1991, Pee-Wee Herman got cancelled for wacking off in a XXX movie theater", "last_comment_created": 1785841520377, "content": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://ew.com/article/1991/08/16/pee-wee-herman-scandal/\" target=\"_blank\">https://ew.com/article/1991/08/16/pee-wee-herman-scandal/</a></p>\n<p>Now, Democrat politicians walk around naked in parades in front of kids AND THEY ARE CELEBRATED INSTEAD OF GOING TO JAIL OR BEING CANCELLED!</p>\n<p>Now there's topless trannys on the White House lawn</p>\n<p>Kevin Spacy's movies were pulled then his accuser is mysteriously killed, then all his movies get put back on the streaming services. He tried to say, now he's a gay man and whatever he did is now ok.</p>\n<p>A CNN host got caught waking off during a work zoom call.</p>\n<p>Now multiple cities and states won't arrest naked people next to schools (Washington, Oregon, probably more)</p>\n<p>Also, those XXX theaters never made any sense. Fill it full of dudes in the dark, THEN WHAT? They shoulda been banned to begin with. Even in the 1980s you were like who the fuck wants to go with a bunch of guys there? WTF are the guys doing in the theater?</p>\n<p>They also lasted crazy long after VHS came out. People would go to video stores, then go to the adult section, get a dirty movie, and GO HOME WITH IT. Yet these dumb theaters lasted way longer after that. Into the 2000s and beyond.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 24, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2084346353983897713", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC9MST7g", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 162, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8762090, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1785793755693, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "godgoldnguns", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC9MST7g.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/i/status/2084346353983897713", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Chart", "last_comment_created": 1785811104134, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 162, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": 